  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nA woman has been dating guy after guy, but it never seems to work out. She’s unaware that she’s actually been dating the same guy over and over; a shapeshifter who’s fallen for her, and is certain he’s going to get it right this time.\n\nOne day, she notices something strange.  She’s been dating a guy who’s a little too perfect, and he’s a little too interested in her. It's like he knows exactly what to do and say, and he hasn't done anything that conflicts with any of her political views. She begins to suspect something is up, and she’s right. She calls the guy she's dating, Sebastian, and tries to trap him into saying something he shouldn't even know about her - one of her darkest secrets.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 8,
  "reference_text": "\n\nShe succeeds, and he reveals himself. She doesn't let him know about the trap quite yet, though. She keeps pushing. She wants to know how he knows about her secret. \"Remember that time when we saw Avatar in 3D?\" She asks. \n\"Yeah, I remember,\" he replies.",
